# Implementation Plan: SolID Wallet Extension + Console + Credential Channel

## Goal

Build three **independent, separately-deployable** projects:

1. **`solid-credential-channel`** — TypeScript library for ECIES credential delivery
2. **`solid-wallet`** — Chrome browser extension (Manifest V3) for credential storage + proof generation
3. **`solid-console`** — Vercel-deployed web dashboard for DAO / Issuer / Verifier roles

All three are **separate repos/directories on Desktop**, independent of the protocol codebase.

