#### Performance Guarantees (No Lag)

| Technique | Where | Why |
|-----------|-------|-----|
| `React.lazy()` + `Suspense` | Each role module | Only loads code for the active role |
| `React.memo` | All list items | Prevents re-render of unchanged items |
| Virtual scrolling (`react-window`) | DataTable | Renders only visible rows, handles 10K+ items |
| `useDeferredValue` | Search/filter inputs | Debounces expensive list filtering |
| Skeleton loaders | Every data-fetching page | Perceived instant load |
| CSS `contain: layout` | Card components | Isolates layout recalculation |
| `will-change: transform` | Animated elements only | GPU compositing |
| Code splitting | Per-role chunks | ~50KB per role instead of ~150KB monolith |

